<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n1223" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀδέσποτος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>without master</i> or
				<i>owner</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀρετὴ ἀ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>R.</u>
					617e
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ παρ᾽ ἡμᾶς ἀ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Epicur.
					<u>Ep.</u>
					3p.65U.
				</span></i>
			: of property, <i><span class="en">
				<u>POxy.</u>
				1188.15
			</span></i> (<i><span class="en">
				13
			</span></i>
			<i><span class="en">
				A.D.
			</span></i>), cf. <i><span class="en">
				Str.
				17.1.12
			</span></i>: of freedmen, <i><span class="en">
				Myro
			</span></i> Hist.<i><span class="en">
				2
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἰκήσεις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>EN</u>
					1161a7
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Hyps.Fr.</u>
				1.11
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. καὶ αὐτοκρατεῖς</span>, of
			the gods, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.426c
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. βίος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Sallust.
					21
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> of rumours or
			writings, <i>anonymous</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Cic.
				<u>Fam.</u>
				15.17.3
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				D.H.
				11.50
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Cic.</u>
				15
			</span></i>, etc. Adv.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-τως</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					J.
					<u>Ap.</u>
					1.16
				</span></i>
			, Sch.<i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Ra.</u>
				1400
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<i>ungovernable</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λύπη</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Democr.
					290
				</span></i>
			.</div>
